title: "Dispatch Realisation of GB Batteries"
abstract: >-
  A public benchmark of how well GB battery BM units declare their available
  energy under Grid Code GC0166 (MDO/MDB), with a declaration-attributable
  £/MW/yr estimate. Pre-registered; open pipeline.
